---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Pricing";
const description = "Simple, transparent pricing for retail businesses of all sizes. No hidden fees, cancel anytime.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  {/* Header */}
  <header class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-50">
    <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between p-6 lg:px-8" aria-label="Global">
      <div class="flex lg:flex-1">
        <a href="/" class="-m-1.5 p-1.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-gray-900">EI POS</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden lg:flex lg:gap-x-12">
        <a href="/features" class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900 hover:text-blue-600 transition">Features</a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-blue-600">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900 hover:text-blue-600 transition">Blog</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden lg:flex lg:flex-1 lg:justify-end lg:gap-x-4">
        <a href="https://app.yourdomain.com/login" class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900 hover:text-blue-600 py-2">Log in</a>
        <a href="https://app.yourdomain.com/signup" class="rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 transition">Get Started</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-blue-600">Pricing</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">
          Pricing that scales with your retail empire.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        Start with a 14-day free trial on the Pro plan. No credit card required. Downgrade to our free Mini plan anytime.
      </p>

      <div class="isolate mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-md grid-cols-1 gap-y-8 sm:mt-20 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-8 xl:gap-x-12">
        
        {/* Plan 1: Mini (Free) */}
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 ring-1 ring-gray-200 xl:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-gray-900">Mini Plan</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">Perfect for side-hustles and single-location kiosks just getting started.</p>
            <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-x-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Free</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-600">forever</span>
            </p>
            <ul role="list" class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                1 Branch Location
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Up to 2 Staff Members
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Up to 50 Products
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Basic Sales Reports
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3 text-gray-400">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
                No Offline Engine
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3 text-gray-400">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" /></svg>
                No Debt Ledger
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <a href="https://app.yourdomain.com/signup" class="mt-8 block rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-blue-600 ring-1 ring-inset ring-blue-200 hover:ring-blue-300">Start for free</a>
        </div>

        {/* Plan 2: Pro (Paid) */}
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 ring-2 ring-blue-600 xl:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl relative">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-6 -translate-y-1/2 transform rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-5 text-white">Most Popular</div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-x-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-blue-600">Pro Plan</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">Full access to the offline engine, advanced analytics, and multi-branch management.</p>
            <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-x-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">₦20,000</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-600">/month per branch</span>
            </p>
            <ul role="list" class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex gap-x-3 font-medium text-gray-900">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Everything in Mini, plus:
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Unlimited Products & Staff
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                100% Offline-First Selling
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Customer Debt Ledger
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Organization-Wide HQ Stats
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <svg class="h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                Loyalty & Rewards Engine
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <a href="https://app.yourdomain.com/signup" class="mt-8 block rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600">Start 14-Day Free Trial</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  {/* FAQ Section */}
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 sm:pb-32 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl divide-y divide-gray-900/10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-gray-900">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <dl class="mt-10 space-y-6 divide-y divide-gray-900/10">
        
        <div class="pt-6">
          <dt>
            <span class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">How exactly does the offline mode work?</span>
          </dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
            <p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">EI POS loads the application and your inventory into your browser's local memory. If your internet cuts out, you can continue to scan items and process cash/debt sales. Once your internet connects again, the system quietly syncs all data to our cloud servers in the background.</p>
          </dd>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <dt>
            <span class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">Do I have to pay per branch?</span>
          </dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
            <p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Yes. The Pro plan is billed per physical location (branch/outlet). This is because each branch requires dedicated inventory syncing, offline database shards, and separate financial ledgers. However, you can have unlimited staff members within each branch at no extra cost.</p>
          </dd>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <dt>
            <span class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-gray-900">What happens when my free trial ends?</span>
          </dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 pr-12">
            <p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">If you haven't entered your payment details by the end of your 14-day trial, your account will be temporarily downgraded. You will not lose your data, but advanced features like the Offline Engine and Debt Ledger will be locked until you subscribe.</p>
          </dd>
        </div>

      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>